INT. GREENHOUSE CONSERVATORY - NIGHT

Glass walls beaded with condensation. Orchids hang like trapped moths. At the center, a wrought-iron table, a half-eaten fig tart, and a toppled chair.

Six people stand around the table. In the chair's place lies the body of the host, a velvet cloak over his chest. Nobody has touched him.

DOCTOR PRUDENCE ACHEBE (50s, tailored green suit) kneels. Fingertips at his throat.

LORD ALISTAIR PENHALLOW-NG (60s, monocle, flushed) stands rigid, a champagne flute shaking in his hand.

MISS TALLULAH "TALLY" BRIGHTWATER (20s, flapper beads) grips the back of a chair.

MR. OSWIN OKONKWO-FRY (40s, butler's tails) holds the door.

GRANDE DAME ESMERALDA VANCE (70s, black lace, cane) watches all of them.

Standing apart, by the orchids: INSPECTOR DEVRAJ "DEV" MARLOWE (40s, rumpled raincoat, soaked).

DEV
No one leaves.

TALLY
Dev, darling, you can't hold us.

DEV
Miss Brightwater, I can hold you till breakfast.

ESMERALDA
Oswin, lock the door.

OSWIN
Already done, madam.

Everyone turns to look at Oswin. Oswin looks at the key in his hand. Doctor Achebe stands. Lord Alistair steps back into an orchid. The flute shatters.

Tally and Dev lunge for the same loose thread of cloak. Oswin bolts for the door. Esmeralda's cane cracks down on his wrist. Alistair collapses into a chair. The doctor catches the key mid-air.

ACHEBE
(calm)
The tart.

Every head turns to the fig tart. One slice missing. A silver fork beside it, tines green.

DEV
Who cut the tart?

Silence. Condensation drips from the glass roof.

ESMERALDA
(softly)
I did, Inspector.
